      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "B = configured batch_size ∈ {3, 9}\n\nAgent LLM API calls\nceil(N / B) + 3\n\nEmbedding model API calls: 0\nExternal canonical judge LLM: 1\n\nNumbered deterministic ALG executions\nN + 3×ceil(N / B) + 6",
      "rawText": "B = configured batch_size ∈ {3, 9}\n\nAgent LLM API calls\nceil(N / B) + 3\n\nEmbedding model API calls: 0\nExternal canonical judge LLM: 1\n\nNumbered deterministic ALG executions\nN + 3×ceil(N / B) + 6",
      "textAlign": "left",
