      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784678400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "SINGLE-TIER MEMORY RULE\n\n• Each batch creates one summary and one validated graph update.\n• B = 3 and B = 9 are separate controlled runs.\n• B = 9 replaces B = 3; there is no additional 9-session reflection.\n• The graph is canonical and append-only; the nested tree is a readable projection.\n• No embeddings are generated or stored.",
      "rawText": "SINGLE-TIER MEMORY RULE\n\n• Each batch creates one summary and one validated graph update.\n• B = 3 and B = 9 are separate controlled runs.\n• B = 9 replaces B = 3; there is no additional 9-session reflection.\n• The graph is canonical and append-only; the nested tree is a readable projection.\n• No embeddings are generated or stored.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SINGLE-TIER MEMORY RULE\n\n• Each batch creates one summary and one validated graph update.\n• B = 3 and B = 9 are separate controlled runs.\n• B = 9 replaces B = 3; there is no additional 9-session reflection.\n• The graph is canonical and append-only; the nested tree is a readable projection.\n• No embeddings are generated or stored.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
